From: Harshit Gupta <39994376+arelyx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:21:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/xenos: 128 vertex uniform vectors; ir2 overflow
 fixes

- Uniforms were capped at 64 vectors because the vertex shader read the
  viewport for gl_FragCoord.z from C65/C66. Move those to C254/C255 on
  Xenos and advertise 128 vertex / 112 fragment uniform vectors (GL 2.0
  wants 128 in the vertex shader; ARB_vertex_program 96 parameters:
  piglit vp-max-array, arb_vertex_program-minmax).
- ir2 overflowed stack arrays on big shaders: sched_next's avail[0x100]
  (stack smashing in dEQP uniform_api.random.3) and assemble's
  block_addr[128]. Size them for the maximum.

